error[duplicate-bounds]: @range cannot be used together with @max
   ┌ test.idl:3:6
   │
 2 │ struct Foo {
 3 │     @range(min = 0, max = 100)
   ·      ^^^^^ @range annotation here
 4 │     @max(50)
   ·      ^^^ @max annotation here
 5 │     int32 value;
 6 │ };
   └──
 help: use either @range or @min/@max, not both
